      "updated": 1786786805429,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "tech stack will use throughout : \n\n\n1 : for the frontend : \n      - react \n      - telwind css v4\n      - lucid icon for the icon \n\n2 . for the backend : \n      - node js \n      - express \n      - for the image storage will  use cloudnary \n      - for the realtime messaging : socket.io \n3 .  for the rag \n      - javascript and  langchain \n      - vector db : croma db \n\n\n.............................\n      ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "tech stack will use throughout : \n\n\n1 : for the frontend : \n      - react \n      - telwind css v4\n      - lucid icon for the icon \n\n2 . for the backend : \n      - node js \n      - express \n      - for the image storage will  use cloudnary \n      - for the realtime messaging : socket.io \n3 .  for the rag \n      - javascript and  langchain \n      - vector db : croma db \n\n\n.............................\n      ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
